      "statement": "get_vector_store selects PGVector for postgres URLs and InMemoryVectorStore otherwise, caches the store per (database_url, collection) because in-memory contents live on the instance, and builds under a reentrant lock with double-checked locking because PGVector's first construction registers tables on a non-thread-safe global Base.",
